commit c330c97683f8ff4748166ac30668050f4a5bf895

C03: a window named only by «la otra» or «la mejor» asks which window (WINDOWS1537)

ARRANGE1229 left «cambiá a la otra ventana» and «enfocá la mejor» as a condition: with nothing before them and no criterion there is no determinate window, and window.focus runs without confirmation. `_unresolved_input_kind` now names «indeterminate_window» (switch/go to «la otra/siguiente/anterior/mejor» window, focus/bring «la otra/mejor/más grande») and `clarify_unresolved_input` composes a validated question asking which window or application, rejecting guessed applications and «no entiendo», with one corrected retry; verified offline against the same model («¿A qué ventana querés cambiar?»).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


